{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_st_06-01",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "st_06-01",
  "title": "別說過去的事",
  "storyCode": "6-6",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6e2f4c9feda011be86f3cd6da7d0e6a623b250c2efb68572f2507b8b6b0f6c0f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "伊諾，這本書是談什麼的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "啊，我讀過了，就給你帶來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我覺得薩沙你會喜歡！這本書是講理想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "理想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "伊諾有什麼理想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......理想啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我不知道。我可以有理想嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "當然可以有，為什麼會沒有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "啊，糟了，該回家了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "不想走嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......我不想回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "可是伊諾你說過，要是不回家，你爸爸就會打你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "明天再見吧？明天還是能再見的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我知道了。麵包和書我就放這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......薩沙，我不想走。好痛。現在回去也會挨打的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "那麼明天來了，你如果被打了，就打我吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "啊？......哈哈哈，薩沙，你是不是跟他們打架，把頭腦打傻了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你的身上還有傷，這麼多傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "只要這樣，就會有人能知道你很痛。至少有人知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "嗯，我知道你的想法。但我不會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "如果那幾個孩子還在路上欺負你，告訴我！我會把他們全打趴的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "明天見！我還會來唱歌給你聽的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我根本不知道他遭遇過什麼。\n我只知道他給過我吃的。\n只知道他能讀書，我也想讀，他就教我。\n只知道其他孩子喜歡欺負他，因為他給我麵包，我更有力氣些，就打了他們，也被他們打過。\n但我不知道他遭遇的是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我很怕。薩沙，我很害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我似乎......似乎不屬於那個家。我偷聽說，我媽媽......我媽媽根本不在家裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "他們看我的眼神，都很可怕，我不想回去了。我不想再回去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "可是，這裡既沒有吃的，也沒有可以住的地方，這裡只是......只是下水道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我不在意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你也討厭我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "什麼？......為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "因為我喜歡笑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "不......不。為什麼會這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "因為我不該笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "沒有這回事！伊諾就應該笑下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "是這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是不是那天他不回去，事情就會改變？\n只因為我覺得我這裡太髒了，太冷了，就讓他回去？\n如果他沒有回去，是不是能改變一切？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你的傷！你肚子上的傷......發生什麼，發生什麼了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "薩沙......我一直在笑啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你看，你和我說可以笑的，我就一直笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "一直在笑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "薩沙，還要聽我唱歌嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "之後，他依然時常來看我。\n只是他身上的傷疤越來越多......\n越來越多。\n我也知道自己說的話會影響他，也減少了張口的次數。\n這會讓事情變好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你的背！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你的背......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......很痛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "不能再這樣下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "究竟是誰做了這些事！為什麼要這麼虐待你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "不管是什麼......這種人都該被毀掉！無論是什麼東西，都該被毀掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "伊諾，帶我去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我會做到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我不知道自己說了什麼。\n也不知道自己是不是什麼都不能再說了。\n我做了什麼？我究竟做了什麼？\n我也讀了許多書了，但沒有書告訴過我。\n什麼都沒告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "看啊，看啊薩沙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你和我說過，希望把傷害我的東西全都毀掉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "快過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你的傷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "不要緊。不要緊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你看，只要輕輕一吹......就都好了。全都會好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "快過來，我給你包紮！布，剩下的布在哪......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "那個男人切了我的腳......只要一吹，就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "有個老頭劃了我的背，撫摸一下，也就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "這都是因為那個胖女人往我嗓子裡塞的那塊源石！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "別說了，伊諾，別說了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我沒辦法再唱歌了，但你看，你看，都虧了這塊源石！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我現在什麼都能做到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "伊諾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......你很不開心。為什麼？我明明按你說的去做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "為什麼你不開心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "明明他們都開心的。只要按他們說的去做，他們就都會開心的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......因為你的所有家人都是混蛋。全部都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "所以孩子們把他們殺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "那些感染的孩子們，還沒被趕到城外的孩子們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你把他們怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "他們也打過我啊。他們還弄傷過你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "現在，他們簡直就像是棋盤上的棋子一樣。棋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "只要我給他們治過身上的傷，讓他們怎麼做，他們就會怎麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我把那群又醜又噁心的人，全都......全部都！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "薩沙，你看，我做的怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "一把火全部燒掉了！全部！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "薩沙，你怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "別再做這種事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "可你不是說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "我沒想到會變成這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "伊諾，做你真正想做的吧。不是這種事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "我會幫你的。別再這樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "可我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "別再這樣了！做你真正想做的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "不是被逼著做什麼，不是流血流淚，也不是什麼復仇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "你根本不喜歡這種事......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......薩沙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我想......唱歌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我什麼也做不到。\n我真是沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "伊諾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "我不能再唱歌了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "我們一起走吧。我們會活下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "活下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "......有什麼好的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "但我們可以一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "你要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "這是我從礦場偷來的源石，本來想要賣掉換些吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊諾",
      "text": "薩沙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "這樣，我們就都是感染者了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "text": "讓我們一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那些事情？我不會過問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你所做的一切都沒有理由。你不是為了什麼理由才活在大地上的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，你根本不需要誰去拯救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "選一個你喜歡的名字吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這個？好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特。從今以後，你就是梅菲斯特。你和以前的你再無瓜葛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不相信你。我沒有權力相信你。能相信你的從來就只有你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你的所作所為不能一筆勾銷，你會永遠背負著你做過的一切，哪怕你忘記了，哪怕你不能理解你做了什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你做的一切，你經歷的一切，都該成為你的薪柴。它們要逼迫著你，要你內心的火繼續燃燒下去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "直到整片大地都解放，直到你拋棄所有別人給你的東西，直到你終於理解你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "到那時候，你連這個名字都可以拋棄。是去是留是生是死，你自己選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特，我不能改變你的理想。如果你沒有，就去找它。我們自己拯救自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我是誰？這不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "想知道怎麼叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我只是個反抗者，一個普通的人。我誰也不是。只是現在，你可以叫我塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而塔露拉沒有和我說太多。\n她抱緊了我。在我的背上叩了三下。\n塔露拉相信我。葉蓮娜，博卓卡斯替，柳德米拉。他們都相信我。\n我本以為我可以把在那座城市度過的童年拋到腦後。\n只是，事情很快就變了。從那個村莊的事情開始。\n那是一樁慘劇。但為什麼這種慘劇會讓她變成這樣？\n為什麼變成這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你要我做什麼，我就會做什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "沒關係的。只要你想做，就去做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我允許了。畢竟你是梅菲斯特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "可是，你以前說過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那是幾年前的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "隨著我們事業的進步，有些事情會自然而然地改變。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "如果不跟上形勢，我們就會被淘汰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所以，我們和我們的感染者同胞，必須爭取一個未來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所有人都可以為了這個理想犧牲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我可以信任你，對吧，領袖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "對。因為我是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我會做到的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你一定會，我相信你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "沒有你，我們做不到。你什麼都可以做，也什麼都可以做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "進來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你應該全都看見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "當然是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "以前的她......不是你這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "塔露拉只是個名字。塔露拉只是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "幫助他吧。梅菲斯特需要你的幫助。梅菲斯特需要你去讓他有價值。他只信任你我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "塔露拉絕不會這樣，你在利用他對你的信任！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我們都沒有選擇的權力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你會為他做到的。一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你想不想看著他死？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你沒意識到嗎？在路過那個村子之後，塔露拉就完全變了！她徹底變了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我知道啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "那為什麼還這麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "除了你和塔露拉姐姐，我誰也不會信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我也不想選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，我們去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，告訴我。我們該怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......我們活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "活著難道不痛苦嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "很痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "但我們可以一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這本書，是談論理想的。\n我的理想是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
